---
title: "repay (Scallop Lend: Borrowing)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_key: verify obligation_key matches obligation.id
    q_validate_key --> q_error_auth: key mismatch
    q_validate_key --> q_accrue: key valid
    q_error_auth --> [*]: revert "unauthorized"
    q_accrue --> q_check_debt: accrue_interest(obligation)
    q_check_debt --> q_error_no_debt: obligation.debts[coin_type] == 0
    q_check_debt --> q_calc_repay: obligation.debts[coin_type] > 0
    q_error_no_debt --> [*]: revert "no debt to repay"
    q_calc_repay --> q_cap_amount: actual_repay = min(repay_amount, obligation.debts[coin_type])
    q_cap_amount --> q_update_debt: obligation.debts[coin_type] -= actual_repay
    q_update_debt --> q_update_pool: asset_pool.total_borrowed -= actual_repay
    q_update_pool --> q_refund: excess = repay_amount - actual_repay
    q_refund --> q_return_excess: excess > 0
    q_refund --> [*]: excess == 0, return success
    q_return_excess --> [*]: transfer(coin(excess), user_address)

    note right of q_cap_amount
        INV-001: Repayment cannot exceed outstanding debt
        INV-002: Excess payment is refunded to user
        INV-003: repay_amount > 0
    end note

    note right of q_accrue
        INV-004: Interest must be accrued before repayment to ensure correct debt amount
        INV-005: After full repayment, obligation.debts[coin_type] == 0
    end note
